{"content_hash": "def58c387fdb2be4", "version_id": 925, "article_id": 93, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "OnePlus puts a cooling fan inside the Ace 7 to keep gamers at 185 frames", "title_zh": "一加把风扇塞进Ace 7，185帧游戏不烫手", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "mydrivers_ev", "source_url": "https://news.mydrivers.com/1/1163/1163909.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600373633615-9b045feaa299?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8cHJvJTIwYWNlJTIwbWFofGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQyODIxOTB8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Badhan Ganesh on Unsplash", "author": "Badhan Ganesh", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@badhanganesh?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/ace-of-spade-playing-card-wYFYDP9r8BY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(28, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(66, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "5044abb86628"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-10", "word_count": 264, "reading_minutes": 1.3, "lead": "OnePlus has fitted an active cooling fan into its new Ace 7, a standard-edition phone that borrows heavily from its Pro sibling. Alongside a 185Hz display and a 9000mAh battery, the handset is aimed squarely at people who play mobile games for hours on end.", "lead_zh": "一加在新款 Ace 7 里装上了主动散热风扇，这款标准版机型大量沿用 Pro 版本的配置。再加上 185Hz 屏幕和 9000mAh 电池，这台手机明显是冲着长时间玩手游的用户来的。", "preview": "The Ace line has always pursued a single goal: squeezing the utmost gaming performance out of a phone. With the Ace 7, OnePlus takes a bolde", "preview_zh": "Ace 系列一直只盯着一个目标：把手机的游戏性能榨到极致。到了 Ace 7，一加更进一步，直接把风扇装进机身，再配上两条专用风道，组成官方所称的双路冰河散热系统。一条风道对着芯片，另一条对着手握的位置，这样性能能稳住，长时间横屏打游戏时手感也不至于发烫。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 905, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/93/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 109.775, "size_bytes": 659664, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 307, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/93/en_c1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 112.05, "size_bytes": 673200, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 307, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/93/en_c1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/93/en_c1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 119.3, "size_bytes": 716688, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 307, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/93/en_c1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/93/en_c1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 103.25, "size_bytes": 620496, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 307, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/93/en_c1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/93/en_c1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 109.975, "size_bytes": 660816, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 307, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/93/en_c1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@1941809/content/data/versions/925.json", "paragraphs": ["The Ace line has always pursued a single goal: squeezing the utmost gaming performance out of a phone. With the Ace 7, OnePlus takes a bolder step by embedding a fan directly in the chassis, paired with two dedicated air channels that form what the company calls a dual-path ice-cooling system. One channel targets the chipset, the other the area where hands grip the phone, so performance holds up while the frame stays comfortable during long landscape sessions.", "Remarkably, the added hardware has not turned the Ace 7 into a bulky, garish gaming device. It retains OnePlus's familiar design language — an aluminium alloy frame, generously rounded corners and the metal cube camera module — and looks much like any conventional flagship. Despite the new vents, it still carries IP66, IP68, IP69 and IP69K dust and water resistance ratings, a rare feat for a phone with moving parts inside.", "The display is the same 185Hz fourth-generation panel used on the OnePlus 16, while power comes from a fifth-generation Snapdragon 8 Elite V series chipset that keeps the third-generation Oryon CPU architecture and a 4.6GHz prime core. A 9000mAh glacier battery, backed by 100W fast charging, rounds out the package. Reviewers measured temperatures dropping by nearly 10°C under load, with games holding a steady 185 frames per second.", "Imaging is handled by a 200-megapixel main camera, supplemented by high-quality two-times cropping for everyday zoom. OnePlus has clearly calibrated the spec sheet with precision: the Ace 7 is a standard-edition flagship built around heavy mobile gamers, offering Pro-grade core features without the Pro price or bulk."], "paragraphs_zh": ["Ace 系列一直只盯着一个目标：把手机的游戏性能榨到极致。到了 Ace 7，一加更进一步，直接把风扇装进机身，再配上两条专用风道，组成官方所称的双路冰河散热系统。一条风道对着芯片，另一条对着手握的位置，这样性能能稳住，长时间横屏打游戏时手感也不至于发烫。", "难得的是，多出来的硬件并没有让 Ace 7 变成又厚又夸张的游戏手机。它延续了一加熟悉的设计语言——铝合金中框、大圆角和金属魔方摄像头模组——看上去和普通直板旗舰没多大差别。尽管多了风道开口，它依然支持 IP66、IP68、IP69 和 IP69K 防尘防水，这对一台内部有活动部件的手机来说相当少见。", "屏幕用的是和一加 16 同款的 185Hz 第四代面板，性能则由第五代骁龙 8 至尊版 V 系列芯片撑起，保留第三代 Oryon CPU 架构和 4.6GHz 超大核。9000mAh 冰川电池加上 100W 快充，把续航这块补齐。评测实测高负载下温度直降近 10℃，游戏能稳稳跑满 185 帧。", "影像由 2 亿像素主摄挑大梁，再靠高素质的两倍裁切补上日常变焦。一加的刀法相当精准：Ace 7 是一台围绕重度手游玩家的标准版旗舰，核心配置看齐 Pro，却没有 Pro 的厚重和价格。"], "body": "The Ace line has always pursued a single goal: squeezing the utmost gaming performance out of a phone. With the Ace 7, OnePlus takes a bolder step by embedding a fan directly in the chassis, paired with two dedicated air channels that form what the company calls a dual-path ice-cooling system. One channel targets the chipset, the other the area where hands grip the phone, so performance holds up while the frame stays comfortable during long landscape sessions.\n\nRemarkably, the added hardware has not turned the Ace 7 into a bulky, garish gaming device. It retains OnePlus's familiar design language — an aluminium alloy frame, generously rounded corners and the metal cube camera module — and looks much like any conventional flagship. Despite the new vents, it still carries IP66, IP68, IP69 and IP69K dust and water resistance ratings, a rare feat for a phone with moving parts inside.\n\nThe display is the same 185Hz fourth-generation panel used on the OnePlus 16, while power comes from a fifth-generation Snapdragon 8 Elite V series chipset that keeps the third-generation Oryon CPU architecture and a 4.6GHz prime core. A 9000mAh glacier battery, backed by 100W fast charging, rounds out the package. Reviewers measured temperatures dropping by nearly 10°C under load, with games holding a steady 185 frames per second.\n\nImaging is handled by a 200-megapixel main camera, supplemented by high-quality two-times cropping for everyday zoom. OnePlus has clearly calibrated the spec sheet with precision: the Ace 7 is a standard-edition flagship built around heavy mobile gamers, offering Pro-grade core features without the Pro price or bulk.", "body_zh": "Ace 系列一直只盯着一个目标：把手机的游戏性能榨到极致。到了 Ace 7，一加更进一步，直接把风扇装进机身，再配上两条专用风道，组成官方所称的双路冰河散热系统。一条风道对着芯片，另一条对着手握的位置，这样性能能稳住，长时间横屏打游戏时手感也不至于发烫。\n\n难得的是，多出来的硬件并没有让 Ace 7 变成又厚又夸张的游戏手机。它延续了一加熟悉的设计语言——铝合金中框、大圆角和金属魔方摄像头模组——看上去和普通直板旗舰没多大差别。尽管多了风道开口，它依然支持 IP66、IP68、IP69 和 IP69K 防尘防水，这对一台内部有活动部件的手机来说相当少见。\n\n屏幕用的是和一加 16 同款的 185Hz 第四代面板，性能则由第五代骁龙 8 至尊版 V 系列芯片撑起，保留第三代 Oryon CPU 架构和 4.6GHz 超大核。9000mAh 冰川电池加上 100W 快充，把续航这块补齐。评测实测高负载下温度直降近 10℃，游戏能稳稳跑满 185 帧。\n\n影像由 2 亿像素主摄挑大梁，再靠高素质的两倍裁切补上日常变焦。一加的刀法相当精准：Ace 7 是一台围绕重度手游玩家的标准版旗舰，核心配置看齐 Pro，却没有 Pro 的厚重和价格。", "text": "The Ace line has always pursued a single goal: squeezing the utmost gaming performance out of a phone. With the Ace 7, OnePlus takes a bolder step by embedding a fan directly in the chassis, paired with two dedicated air channels that form what the company calls a dual-path ice-cooling system. One channel targets the chipset, the other the area where hands grip the phone, so performance holds up while the frame stays comfortable during long landscape sessions. Remarkably, the added hardware has not turned the Ace 7 into a bulky, garish gaming device. It retains OnePlus's familiar design language — an aluminium alloy frame, generously rounded corners and the metal cube camera module — and looks much like any conventional flagship. Despite the new vents, it still carries IP66, IP68, IP69 and IP69K dust and water resistance ratings, a rare feat for a phone with moving parts inside. The display is the same 185Hz fourth-generation panel used on the OnePlus 16, while power comes from a fifth-generation Snapdragon 8 Elite V series chipset that keeps the third-generation Oryon CPU architecture and a 4.6GHz prime core. A 9000mAh glacier battery, backed by 100W fast charging, rounds out the package. Reviewers measured temperatures dropping by nearly 10°C under load, with games holding a steady 185 frames per second. Imaging is handled by a 200-megapixel main camera, supplemented by high-quality two-times cropping for everyday zoom. OnePlus has clearly calibrated the spec sheet with precision: the Ace 7 is a standard-edition flagship built around heavy mobile gamers, offering Pro-grade core features without the Pro price or bulk.", "vocab": [{"word": "squeeze out", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "榨取，挤出", "note": "常与 performance、value 等搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "chassis", "pos": "noun", "zh": "机身，底盘", "note": "电子产品中指机身框架", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "garish", "pos": "adj", "zh": "花哨的，俗艳的", "note": "贬义，形容外观过于张扬", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "retain", "pos": "verb", "zh": "保留，保持", "note": "正式用词，比 keep 更书面", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "generously rounded", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "大圆角的", "note": "形容工业设计", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "vent", "pos": "noun", "zh": "通风口，散热孔", "note": "常与 air 搭配，air vent", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "round out", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "使完整，补齐", "note": "round out the package 意为补齐整体配置", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "under load", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "在高负载下", "note": "技术语境常用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "supplement", "pos": "verb", "zh": "补充，辅助", "note": "常用被动 be supplemented by", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "calibrate", "pos": "verb", "zh": "校准，精准拿捏", "note": "此处引申为精准配置", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "spec sheet", "pos": "noun", "zh": "配置表，参数表", "note": "数码评测高频词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "squarely", "pos": "adv", "zh": "明确地，直截了当地", "note": "aim squarely at 意为明确瞄准", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "utmost", "pos": "adj", "zh": "最大的，极度的", "note": "the utmost performance 极致性能", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "feat", "pos": "noun", "zh": "壮举，了不起的事", "note": "a rare feat 难得之举", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-10T03:43:09.016021", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.375, "sm": 250, "em": 375, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Ace", "s": 0.375, "e": 0.625, "sm": 375, "em": 625, "cs": 4, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "line", "s": 0.625, "e": 0.95, "sm": 625, "em": 949, "cs": 8, "ce": 12, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "has", "s": 0.95, "e": 1.137, "sm": 950, "em": 1137, "cs": 13, "ce": 16, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "always", "s": 1.137, "e": 1.525, "sm": 1137, "em": 1524, "cs": 17, "ce": 23, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "pursued", "s": 1.525, "e": 1.887, "sm": 1525, "em": 1887, "cs": 24, "ce": 31, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "a", "s": 1.887, "e": 1.988, "sm": 1887, "em": 1987, "cs": 32, "ce": 33, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "single", "s": 1.988, "e": 2.325, "sm": 1987, "em": 2325, "cs": 34, "ce": 40, "si": 0}, {"i": 8,